ss editor, large-project performance.\",\n\"non_responsibilities\": [\n[\n\"Panels and inspectors\",\n\"editor-ui-framework\"\n],\n[\n\"World viewport tools\",\n\"world-editor-viewport\"\n],\n[\n\"Source control\",\n\"collaboration-version-control\"\n]\n],\n\"provides\": [\n\"C-EDCMD\"\n],\n\"consumes\": [\n\"C-REFL\",\n\"C-SER\",\n\"C-ASSET\",\n\"C-WORLD\",\n\"C-PLUGIN\",\n\"C-UI?\"\n],\n\"expertise\": [\n\"editor architecture\",\n\"command pattern\",\n\"tool UX\"\n]\n}\n----\n{\n\"id\": \"editor-ui-framework\",\n\"name\": \"Editor UI Framework\",\n\"tier\": \"expert\",\n\"parent\": \"editor-architect\",\n\"profiles\": [\n\"client\"\n],\n\"runtime\": false,\n\"purpose\": \"Tool UI toolkit (docking, panels), reflection-driven inspectors, asset browser, immediate-mode developer UI, editor UX standards.\",\n\"non_responsibilities\": [\n[\n\"Game UI\",\n\"ui-architect\"\n],\n[\n\"Graph editors\",\n\"graph-editor-framework\"\n]\n],\n\"provides\": [],\n\"consumes\": [\n\"C-EDCMD\",\n\"C-REFL\",\n\"C-DRAW2D\",\n\"C-TEXT\"\n],\n\"expertise\": [\n\"tool UI\",\n\"Dear ImGui-class toolkits\",\n\"UX research\"\n]\n}\n----\n{\n\"id\": \"world-editor-viewport\",\n\"name\": \"World Editor & Viewport\",\n\"tier\": \"expert\",\n\"parent\": \"editor-architect\",\n\"profiles\": [\n\"client\"\n],\n\"runtime\": false,\n\"purpose\": \"Viewport and navigation, gizmos, snapping and placement, partition-aware world editing, spline tools, environment tool-mode hosting.\",\n\"non_responsibilities\": [\n[\n\"Terrain tool logic\",\n\"terrain\"\n],\n[\n\"World format\",\n\"world-data-model\"\n]\n],\n\"provides\": [],\n\"consumes\": [\n\"C-EDCMD\",\n\"C-WORLD\",\n\"C-RSCENE\",\n\"C-SPATIAL\"\n],\n\"expertise\": [\n\"3D manipulation UX\",\n\"large-world editing\"\n]\n}\n----\n{\n\"id\": \"graph-editor-framework\",\n\"name\": \"Graph Editor Framework\",\n\"tier\": \"expert\",\n\"parent\": \"editor-architect\",\n\"profiles\": [\n\"client\"\n],\n\"runtime\": false,\n\"purpose\": \"Shared node-graph 