{"parentUuid":"b127a1de-b9d0-4f60-b239-412701261e34","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a65819c69c5860f4b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RNaL1GcAVdgWSj2nqjqJW9","type":"tool_result","content":"== ARCH Engine architecture, governance & agent organization 24\n   ARCH.REQ Requirements & configuration profiles 4\n   ARCH.STRUCT Structure & boundaries 6\n   ARCH.GOV Architecture governance 5\n   ARCH.EVID Research & evidence 4\n   ARCH.ORG Agent organization 5\n== PLAT Platform & hardware abstraction 33\n   PLAT.PAL Platform abstraction layer 7\n   PLAT.DESK Desktop & handheld PC 4\n   PLAT.CON Console-class platforms 4\n   PLAT.MOB Mobile & portable 4\n   PLAT.SVC Platform & online services integration 8\n   PLAT.XR XR 6\n== CORE Core runtime foundations 80\n   CORE.LIFE Lifecycle, modules, configuration, errors 8\n   CORE.MATH Math & numerics 10\n   CORE.MEM Memory 9\n   CORE.TYPES Core types & containers 6\n   CORE.CONC Concurrency primitives 5\n   CORE.JOBS Jobs, task graphs, fibers 9\n   CORE.FRAME Frame & time orchestration 7\n   CORE.OBJ Object model & identity 4\n   CORE.ECS Entity component system 9\n   CORE.REFL Reflection & metadata 6\n   CORE.SER Serialization & schema 7\n== RES Resources, IO, packaging & streaming 18\n   RES.MGMT Runtime resource management 7\n   RES.IO Asynchronous IO 6\n   RES.PKG Packages & virtual file system 5\n== CNT Asset identity & content pipeline 23\n   CNT.ID Asset identity & registry 4\n   CNT.IMP Import & interchange 9\n   CNT.COOK Cooking & derived data 8\n   CNT.VAL Content validation 2\n== WLD World representation, streaming & environment 40\n   WLD.MODEL World model 7\n   WLD.PART Partitioning & streaming 6\n   WLD.SPACE Transforms & spatial queries 5\n   WLD.ENV Environment systems 17\n   WLD.PCG Procedural generation 5\n== RND Rendering 130\n   RND.ARCH Render architecture 8\n   RND.RHI Hardware interface 10\n   RND.MEM GPU memory & resources 6\n   RND.GRAPH Render graph & GPU scheduling 9\n   RND.SHADER Shader system 9\n   RND.MAT Materials 6\n   RND.GEO GPU-driven geometry pipeline 7\n   RND.LOD Level of detail & virtualized geometry 8\n   RND.TEX Textures & virtual texturing 6\n   RND.LIGHT Direct lighting & shadows 9\n   RND.GI Global illumination & reflections 9\n   RND.RT Ray tracing infrastructure 8\n   RND.PT Path tracing 3\n   RND.RECON Reconstruction, resolution & denoising 7\n   RND.POST Post-processing, HDR & color 6\n   RND.TRANS Translucency & decals 4\n   RND.CHAR Character rendering 4\n   RND.2D 2D, vector & UI rendering 6\n   RND.VFX Particles & VFX 5\n== ML Machine-learning runtime 5\n   ML.RT Inference 5\n== PHY Physics & simulation 41\n   PHY.ARCH Physics architecture 7\n   PHY.COL Collision 8\n   PHY.DYN Rigid-body dynamics 6\n   PHY.CTRL Characters & vehicles 4\n   PHY.SOFT Deformables 5\n   PHY.DEST Destruction 4\n   PHY.FLUID Fluids 4\n   PHY.2D 2D physics 3\n== ANM Animation 35\n   ANM.ARCH Animation architecture 5\n   ANM.RT Animation runtime 6\n   ANM.DEF Skinning & deformation 5\n   ANM.GRAPH Animation graphs 4\n   ANM.SYN Motion synthesis 4\n   ANM.IK IK, procedural & physical animation 4\n   ANM.FACE Facial animation 3\n   ANM.CINE Cinematics 4\n== AUD Audio 24\n   AUD.ARCH Audio architecture 5\n   AUD.DSP DSP & mixing 7\n   AUD.SPAT Spatial audio & acoustics 7\n   AUD.CONTENT Audio content runtime 5\n== INP Input 16\n   INP.DEV Devices 8\n   INP.ACT Actions 8\n== NET Networking & multiplayer 34\n   NET.ARCH Network architecture 6\n   NET.TRANS Transport 9\n   NET.REP Replication 8\n   NET.PRED Prediction & latency hiding 6\n   NET.SRV Servers 5\n== GAM Gameplay, scripting, AI & persistence 40\n   GAM.FW Gameplay framework 4\n   GAM.SYS Gameplay systems toolkit 6\n   GAM.SCR Scripting 8\n   GAM.AI Navigation, crowds & AI 15\n   GAM.SAVE Persistence 7\n== UI UI, text, localization & accessibility 29\n   UI.FW UI framework 8\n   UI.TXT Text & fonts 6\n   UI.LOC Localization 7\n   UI.A11Y Accessibility 8\n== ED Editor & content tools 38\n   ED.ARCH Editor architecture 9\n   ED.UI Editor UI framework 5\n   ED.WORLD World editor 6\n   ED.GRAPH Graph editors 4\n   ED.COLLAB Collaboration & version control 6\n   ED.DEBUG Visual debugging 5\n   ED.AI AI-assisted authoring 3\n== BLD Build, CI/CD & release 25\n   BLD.SYS Build system 8\n   BLD.CI CI/CD & automation 9\n   BLD.REL Packaging & release 8\n== QA Testing & validation 28\n   QA.STRAT Test strategy 7\n   QA.RENDER Rendering validation 4\n   QA.FUNC Functional & stability testing 6\n   QA.ROBUST Robustness 4\n   QA.CERT Certification & compliance 7\n== PRF Performance engineering 22\n   PRF.METH Method & budgets 4\n   PRF.BENCH Benchmarking 5\n   PRF.CPU CPU performance 5\n   PRF.GPU GPU performance 4\n   PRF.LOAD Loading & hitches 4\n== OBS Observability & diagnostics 15\n   OBS.LOG Instrumentation 8\n   OBS.CRASH Crash & hang diagnostics 7\n== XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines 39\n   XC.DET Determinism & replay 6\n   XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration 4\n   XC.SEC Security 11\n   XC.EXT Extensibility & evolution 11\n   XC.DX Documentation & developer experience 7","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5ddbcdc8-5ca9-470c-8e52-e3b17b54b976","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:46:05.729Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b127a1de-b9d0-4f60-b239-412701261e34","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
