{"parentUuid":"2af5331c-5a3c-40e6-bfad-0d44e6e65499","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a65819c69c5860f4b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G4aPQrZFfpw175pJpGMMCW","type":"tool_result","content":"data/capabilities.json:55:        [\"PLAT.DESK.server-host\", \"Server host OS specifics (Linux containers)\", \"platform-desktop\", \"E\", [\"dedicated-server\"]]\ndata/capabilities.json:284:        [\"WLD.ENV.terrain-tools\", \"Terrain sculpt & paint tool logic\", \"terrain\", \"E\", [\"world-editor-viewport\"]],\ndata/capabilities.json:704:        [\"NET.SRV.listen\", \"Listen servers & host migration\", \"dedicated-server\", \"E\", [\"network-architect\"]]\ndata/capabilities.json:769:        [\"UI.FW.authoring\", \"UI designer tool logic\", \"ui-architect\", \"E\", [\"editor-ui-framework\"]],\ndata/capabilities.json:826:        [\"ED.WORLD.modes\", \"Environment tool-mode hosting\", \"world-editor-viewport\", \"E\", [\"terrain\"]]\ndata/skills.json:189:     \"purpose\": \"Windows, Linux, SteamOS and macOS integration: display modes, HDR and VRR capability, DPI, OS-specific IO and scheduling behavior, handheld-PC specifics, server host OS.\",\ndata/skills.json:202:     \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"Game-server hosting\", \"dedicated-server\"], [\"Save-game content\", \"persistence-save\"], [\"Backend implementation (outside engine scope)\", \"engine-architect\"]],\ndata/skills.json:226:     \"purpose\": \"Generic processors: texture processing and GPU texture-compression encoding, mesh optimization, hosting of collision and other domain builders under the cook contract.\",\ndata/skills.json:256:     \"purpose\": \"Terrain end-to-end: representation, rendering, material layering, sculpt/paint tool logic, runtime deformation, collision data hand-off.\",\ndata/skills.json:257:     \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"Virtual texturing core\", \"texture-streaming-vt\"], [\"Viewport hosting\", \"world-editor-viewport\"], [\"Collision algorithms\", \"collision-detection\"]],\ndata/skills.json:453:     \"purpose\": \"Headless server builds and stripping, tick cost and multi-instance density, fleet orchestration boundary, server observability, listen servers and host migration.\",\ndata/skills.json:487:     \"purpose\": \"UI architecture (retained with data binding for game UI, immediate for developer UI), layout, styling, focus and navigation, animation, in-world UI, designer tool logic, UI performance.\",\ndata/skills.json:508:     \"purpose\": \"Viewport and navigation, gizmos, snapping and placement, partition-aware world editing, spline tools, environment tool-mode hosting.\",\ndata/skills.json:509:     \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"Terrain tool logic\", \"terrain\"], [\"World format\", \"world-data-model\"]],\n\nRND.ARCH.pipeline | Rendering pipeline organization & feature composition | render-architect | E | \nRND.ARCH.shading-path | Shading path choice (forward+, deferred, visibility buffer) | render-architect | E | \nRND.ARCH.feature-contract | Render feature / plugin contract | render-architect | E | \nRND.ARCH.scene-sync | Render scene representation & world → render sync | render-architect | E | ['gpu-driven-pipeline']\nRND.ARCH.scalability | Render scalability tiers | render-architect | E | ['performance-architect']\nRND.ARCH.multiview | Multi-view rendering (split-screen, PiP, render targets, captures) | render-architect | E | \nRND.ARCH.debug-modes | Buffer visualization & render debug modes | render-architect | E | ['visual-debugging-tools']\nRND.ARCH.threading | Parallel command recording & render threading model | render-architect | E | ['rhi-core']\nRND.SHADER.language | Shading language & dialect (HLSL, Slang) | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.toolchain | Compilation toolchain (DXC, Slang, SPIR-V, Metal shader converter) | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.permutations | Permutation management & specialization | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.reflection | Shader reflection & binding-layout generation | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.interop | Shared C++/shader interop headers | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.cache | Shader caches & distributed compilation | shader-system | E | ['ci-cd-automation']\nRND.SHADER.reload | Shader hot reload | shader-system | E | ['hot-reload-iteration']\nRND.SHADER.debug | Shader debugging & GPU printf | shader-system | E | \nRND.SHADER.pso-lists | PSO / permutation list gathering from play traces | shader-system | E | ['rhi-core']\nRND.MAT.model | Material model (OpenPBR-class, layered) | material-system | E | \nRND.MAT.graph | Material graph → shader code generation | material-system | E | ['graph-editor-framework']\nRND.MAT.instances | Material instances & runtime parameters | material-system | E | \nRND.MAT.tiers | Material quality tiers & LOD | material-system | E | \nRND.MAT.neural | Neural materials | material-system | X | ['ml-inference-runtime']\nRND.MAT.validation | Material validation (energy conservation, furnace tests) | material-system | E | ['render-validation']\nRND.LOD.clusters | Cluster hierarchy / virtualized geometry | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | \nRND.LOD.cluster-build | Cluster DAG building & simplification (cook side) | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | ['asset-cook-processors']\nRND.LOD.swraster | Software rasterization of micro-polygons | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | \nRND.LOD.streaming | Cluster / page streaming | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | ['resource-streaming-architect']\nRND.LOD.discrete | Discrete LOD generation & selection | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | \nRND.LOD.hlod | HLOD proxy meshes & impostors | virtualized-geometry-lod | E | \nRND.LOD.deforming | LOD for skinned / deforming geometry | virtualized-geometry-lod | M | ['deformation-skinning']\nRND.LOD.displacement | Displacement / tessellation on virtualized geometry | virtualized-geometry-lod | M | \nRND.LIGHT.units | Light types & physical light units | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.clustered | Clustered / tiled light culling | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.stochastic | Stochastic many-light sampling (ReSTIR DI class) | direct-lighting-shadows | M | \nRND.LIGHT.area | Area lights (LTC) | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.csm | Cascaded shadow maps | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.vsm | Virtual shadow maps | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.rt-shadows | Ray-traced shadows | direct-lighting-shadows | E | ['ray-tracing-infrastructure']\nRND.LIGHT.contact | Contact / screen-space shadows | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.LIGHT.profiles | Light functions & IES profiles | direct-lighting-shadows | E | \nRND.GI.baked | Baked lighting & GPU lightmap baking | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.probes | Irradiance / radiance probe volumes (DDGI class) | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.screen-space | Screen-space GI & ambient occlusion | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.hybrid | Surface / radiance-cache hybrid GI (software + hardware RT) | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.restir | ReSTIR GI & path-traced GI | global-illumination | M | \nRND.GI.reflections | Reflections (screen-space, ray-traced, probes) | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.sky | Sky lighting & environment capture | global-illumination | E | ['atmosphere-weather']\nRND.GI.specular-occlusion | Specular occlusion | global-illumination | E | \nRND.GI.sdf | SDF / voxel scene representations for tracing | global-illumination | E | ['ray-tracing-infrastructure']\nRND.POST.effects | Post chain (bloom, depth of field, motion blur, lens) | post-color-hdr | E | \nRND.POST.camera | Physical camera & exposure | post-color-hdr | E | \nRND.POST.color | Color management pipeline (working space, ACES 2.0 class output transforms, OCIO) | post-color-hdr | E | \nRND.POST.hdr-output | HDR output (PQ, scRGB, metadata, calibration) | post-color-hdr | E | ['rhi-core']\nRND.POST.tonemap | Tonemapping & display mapping | post-color-hdr | E | \nRND.POST.grading | Grading LUTs, film grain, sharpening | post-color-hdr | E | \nRND.CHAR.skin | Skin subsurface scattering | character-rendering | E | \nRND.CHAR.eyes | Eyes | character-rendering | E | \nRND.CHAR.hair | Strand-based hair & fur rendering | character-rendering | M | \nRND.CHAR.lod | Digital-human LOD | character-rendering | E | \nRND.2D.sprites | Sprite batching | render-2d-vector | E | \nRND.2D.tilemaps | Tilemaps | render-2d-vector | E | \nRND.2D.lighting | 2D lighting & shadows | render-2d-vector | E | \nRND.2D.vector | Vector graphics / path rendering | render-2d-vector | E | \nRND.2D.ui-backend | UI render backend (batching, clipping, SDF, HDR compositing) | render-2d-vector | E | ['ui-architect']\nRND.2D.pixel | Pixel-perfect & retro presentation | render-2d-vector | E | \nRND.VFX.gpu-sim | GPU particle simulation | vfx-particles | E | \nRND.VFX.graph | VFX graph runtime | vfx-particles | E | ['graph-editor-framework']\nRND.VFX.primitives | Ribbons, beams, mesh particles | vfx-particles | E | \nRND.VFX.collision | Particle collision (depth buffer, SDF) | vfx-particles | E | \nRND.VFX.budgets | VFX budgets, LOD & significance | vfx-particles | E | ['performance-architect']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3f7635f4-3336-41ab-8e49-b399f36b6568","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:46:18.706Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2af5331c-5a3c-40e6-bfad-0d44e6e65499","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
