{"parentUuid":"4a35b09a-b467-44b0-988d-69f711eb7a73","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a65819c69c5860f4b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016E4PWVhCvB5Vg6xCkUjhgc","type":"tool_result","content":"performance-architect :: Owns performance as a discipline: the hypothesis → instrumentation → measurement → optimization → regression-test loop, budgets per subsystem and hardware tier, the scalability / device-profile framework, and performance gates.\n   NR: [[\"Optimizing a subsystem's code (its owner does, with review)\", 'cpu-performance'], ['Instrumentation API', 'observability-telemetry'], ['Benchmark harness', 'perf-benchmarking']]\n   C: ['C-INSTR', 'C-CFG'] P: ['C-BUDGET']\nobservability-telemetry :: Instrumentation substrate: structured logging, trace zones (CPU, GPU, IO, memory), counters and metrics, profiler integrations, in-game stats, development and live telemetry with privacy consent; zero cost when compiled out.\n   NR: [['Crash capture', 'crash-diagnostics'], ['Debug drawing and consoles', 'visual-debugging-tools'], ['Perf budgets', 'performance-architect']]\n   C: ['C-PAL'] P: ['C-INSTR']\nplugin-system :: Plugin architecture: manifests, discovery, dependency resolution, load phases, binary vs source plugins, isolation, distribution format.\n   NR: [['Mods & UGC', 'modding-ugc'], ['Module linking internals', 'core-runtime-architect']]\n   C: ['C-MOD'] P: ['C-PLUGIN']\nmodding-ugc :: Mod and UGC support: mod SDK, content overrides via VFS layering, sandboxed mod scripting, UGC upload and moderation boundaries, mod compatibility across patches.\n   NR: [['Sandbox policy', 'security-engineering'], ['Script VM', 'scripting-runtime']]\n   C: ['C-VFS', 'C-SCRIPT', 'C-PLUGIN', 'C-SVC'] P: []\nworld-architect :: World representation strategy (data-oriented, no universal scene graph), partitioning and streaming cells, streaming sources, HLOD strategy, simulation LOD and significance, large-world coordinate policy, level transitions, server-side world streaming.\n   NR: [['World document format', 'world-data-model'], ['Transform math', 'spatial-transforms'], ['HLOD mesh generation', 'virtualized-geometry-lod']]\n   C: ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-RES', 'C-ECS'] P: ['C-WORLD']\nworld-data-model :: World and level documents, prefabs with nested overrides and variants, data layers, one-file-per-object layout for collaboration, level instances.\n   NR: [['Serialization mechanics', 'serialization-schema'], ['Source-control workflows', 'collaboration-version-control']]\n   C: ['C-WORLD', 'C-SER', 'C-ASSET', 'C-ID'] P: []\nterrain :: Terrain end-to-end: representation, rendering, material layering, sculpt/paint tool logic, runtime deformation, collision data hand-off.\n   NR: [['Virtual texturing core', 'texture-streaming-vt'], ['Viewport hosting', 'world-editor-viewport'], ['Collision algorithms', 'collision-detection']]\n   C: ['C-WORLD', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-PHYS', 'C-RES', 'C-MATIF', 'C-EDCMD?'] P: []\nvegetation-foliage :: Vegetation instancing and rendering, procedural placement rules, wind and interaction, vegetation-specific LOD.\n   NR: [['Generic PCG framework', 'procedural-generation'], ['Impostor generation', 'virtualized-geometry-lod']]\n   C: ['C-WORLD', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-RES', 'C-PHYS?'] P: []\nwater-ocean :: Ocean spectral simulation, rivers, lakes and shorelines, water surface rendering, water queries for buoyancy.\n   NR: [['Buoyancy dynamics', 'character-vehicle-physics'], ['Fluid solvers', 'fluid-simulation']]\n   C: ['C-WORLD', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-PHYS', 'C-RG'] P: []\natmosphere-weather :: Sky and atmospheric scattering, volumetric clouds, volumetric fog and local media, weather state and surface response, time of day.\n   NR: [['Sky lighting capture for GI', 'global-illumination'], ['Translucency compositing', 'translucency-decals']]\n   C: ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-FRAME'] P: []\nprocedural-generation :: Deterministic graph-based PCG framework usable in editor and at stream-in, placement and scattering rules, grammar and constraint methods; evaluates ML generation.\n   NR: [['Foliage-specific rules', 'vegetation-foliage'], ['Graph editor UI', 'graph-editor-framework']]\n   C: ['C-WORLD', 'C-COOK?', 'C-DET', 'C-GRAPH?'] P: []\nrender-architect :: Rendering architecture: pipeline organization, shading-path choice (forward+, deferred, visibility buffer), render-feature contract, render scene and world→render sync, scalability tiers from 2D mobile to path-traced, multi-view, debug modes, render threading.\n   NR: [['API backends', 'rhi-core'], ['Pass scheduling', 'render-graph-scheduling'], ['Individual features (GI, shadows…)', 'global-illumination']]\n   C: ['C-RG', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-MATIF', 'C-FRAME', 'C-ECS'] P: ['C-RSCENE']\nshader-system :: Shading language and dialect, compilation toolchain, permutations, reflection and binding layouts, interop headers, caches and distributed compilation, hot reload, shader debugging, PSO-list gathering.\n   NR: [['Material graphs', 'material-system'], ['Runtime PSO cache', 'rhi-core']]\n   C: ['C-RHI', 'C-COOK', 'C-RELOAD'] P: ['C-SHADER']\nmaterial-system :: Material model (OpenPBR-class, layered), material graph → shader code generation, instances and parameters, quality tiers, material validation; evaluates neural materials.\n   NR: [['BRDF research reference', 'research-evidence'], ['Graph editor UI', 'graph-editor-framework'], ['Shader compiler', 'shader-system']]\n   C: ['C-SHADER', 'C-GRAPH?', 'C-ASSET'] P: ['C-MATIF']\nvirtualized-geometry-lod :: All geometric LOD: cluster hierarchies and virtualized geometry, cluster DAG building, software micro-polygon rasterization, cluster streaming, discrete LOD, HLOD proxies and impostors, deforming-geometry LOD, displacement.\n   NR: [['HLOD strategy', 'world-architect'], ['Generic mesh optimization', 'asset-cook-processors'], ['RT acceleration structures', 'ray-tracing-infrastructure']]\n   C: ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-RES', 'C-COOK', 'C-RT?'] P: []\nglobal-illumination :: Indirect lighting across tiers: baked lightmaps, probe volumes, screen-space GI and AO, surface/radiance-cache hybrid GI, ReSTIR GI, reflections, sky lighting, specular occlusion, SDF scene representations.\n   NR: [['RT infrastructure', 'ray-tracing-infrastructure'], ['Atmosphere model', 'atmosphere-weather']]\n   C: ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-RT?', 'C-TEMPORAL', 'C-COOK?'] P: []\ncharacter-rendering :: Skin subsurface scattering, eyes, strand-based hair and fur rendering, digital-human LOD.\n   NR: [['Hair simulation', 'cloth-deformables'], ['Skinning', 'deformation-skinning']]\n   C: ['C-RSCENE', 'C-MATIF', 'C-ANIM', 'C-RG'] P: []\nrender-2d-vector :: 2D draw backend shared by 2D games, UI and debug overlays: sprites, tilemaps, 2D lighting, vector paths, UI batching/clipping/SDF, HDR compositing, pixel-perfect modes.\n   NR: [['Widget model', 'ui-architect'], ['Glyph shaping', 'text-fonts']]\n   C: ['C-RG', 'C-SHADER', 'C-TEXT'] P: ['C-DRAW2D']\nvfx-particles :: GPU particle simulation, VFX graph runtime, ribbons/beams/mesh particles, particle collision, VFX budgets and significance.\n   NR: [['Physically based fluids', 'fluid-simulation'], ['Translucency sorting', 'translucency-decals']]\n   C: ['C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-GRAPH?', 'C-PHYS?'] P: []\nphysics-architect :: Physics architecture: build vs integrate decision, physics world representation and ECS integration, stepping and frame sync, determinism levels, physics LOD, materials, GPU offload evaluation; covers both 2D and 3D.\n   NR: [['Collision algorithms', 'collision-detection'], ['Solvers', 'rigid-body-dynamics'], ['Networked physics', 'prediction-rollback']]\n   C: ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-ECS', 'C-FRAME', 'C-DET', 'C-TASK'] P: ['C-PHYS']\ndestruction-fracture :: Fracture authoring and precomputation, runtime fracture and debris, destruction replication strategy, propagation to navigation, rendering and audio.\n   NR: [['Replication mechanics', 'replication'], ['Navmesh rebuild', 'navigation-pathfinding']]\n   C: ['C-PHYS', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-NET?', 'C-COOK?'] P: []\nphysics-2d :: 2D rigid bodies and collision, 2D character controllers, 2D determinism.\n   NR: [['3D physics', 'rigid-body-dynamics']]\n   C: ['C-PHYS', 'C-DET'] P: []\nanimation-architect :: Animation architecture: data model, parallel evaluation pipeline, animation/physics/gameplay sync and root-motion policy, animation LOD, budgets.\n   NR: [['Sampling and blending', 'animation-runtime'], ['Skinning', 'deformation-skinning']]\n   C: ['C-ECS', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-FRAME', 'C-TASK', 'C-PHYS?'] P: ['C-ANIM']\nanimation-runtime :: Sampling and decompression, compression, blending/layering/masks/additives, retargeting, curves and notifies, 2D skeletal and flipbook animation.\n   NR: [['State machines', 'animation-graphs'], ['IK', 'ik-procedural-animation']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-COOK?', 'C-MATH'] P: []\ndeformation-skinning :: GPU skinning (linear, dual quaternion), morph targets, ML deformers, deformed-geometry acceleration-structure updates, deformation motion vectors.\n   NR: [['Cloth', 'cloth-deformables'], ['Facial solvers', 'facial-animation']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-RG', 'C-TEMPORAL', 'C-RT?', 'C-ML?'] P: []\nanimation-graphs :: Animation graphs and state machines, blend spaces, graph compilation and data-driven evaluation, graph debugging and rewind.\n   NR: [['Graph editor UI', 'graph-editor-framework'], ['Motion matching', 'motion-synthesis']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-GRAPH?'] P: []\nmotion-synthesis :: Motion matching, learned motion matching and neural controllers, pose databases, trajectory prediction and gameplay coupling.\n   NR: [['ML runtime', 'ml-inference-runtime'], ['Locomotion gameplay', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-COOK?', 'C-ML?'] P: []\nik-procedural-animation :: IK solvers, foot placement, procedural animation, physical animation and active ragdoll.\n   NR: [['Rigid-body solver', 'rigid-body-dynamics'], ['Motion matching', 'motion-synthesis']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-PHYS'] P: []\nfacial-animation :: Facial rigs and solvers, audio-driven and ML lip sync, performance-capture import.\n   NR: [['Face rendering', 'character-rendering'], ['Dialogue playback', 'audio-content-runtime']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-AUDIO', 'C-ML?'] P: []\ncinematics-sequencer :: Timeline/sequencer, camera cuts and cinematic cameras, high-quality movie rendering, cutscene streaming and preloading.\n   NR: [['Gameplay camera', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit'], ['Path tracer', 'path-tracing']]\n   C: ['C-ANIM', 'C-AUDIO', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-RES', 'C-EDCMD?'] P: []\naudio-architect :: Audio engine architecture and threading, device backends, voice management and virtualization, middleware decision, audio budgets.\n   NR: [['DSP algorithms', 'audio-dsp-mixing'], ['Spatialization', 'spatial-audio-acoustics']]\n   C: ['C-PAL', 'C-TASK', 'C-ECS', 'C-SPATIAL'] P: ['C-AUDIO']\naudio-content-runtime :: Audio event system and parameters, interactive music, dialogue and VO, authoring tool integration, audio-to-haptics.\n   NR: [['Localization pipeline', 'localization-i18n'], ['Haptics devices', 'input-devices-haptics']]\n   C: ['C-AUDIO', 'C-ASSET', 'C-LOC', 'C-GRAPH?'] P: []\nnetwork-architect :: Netcode model per game type (authoritative server, lockstep, rollback, P2P/relay), network tick and time, authority model, budgets and scale targets, protocol versioning, sharded worlds evaluation.\n   NR: [['Transport', 'network-transport'], ['Replication mechanics', 'replication'], ['Matchmaking services', 'platform-online-services']]\n   C: ['C-ECS', 'C-SER', 'C-FRAME', 'C-DET'] P: ['C-NET']\ngameplay-architect :: Gameplay framework: rules, players and possession, extension points and game-module structure, game flow and transitions, local players.\n   NR: [['Abilities/tags/camera toolkit', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit'], ['Scripting VM', 'scripting-runtime'], ['Game-specific code (the game team)', 'engine-architect']]\n   C: ['C-ECS', 'C-INPUT?', 'C-PHYS', 'C-ANIM', 'C-AUDIO?', 'C-NET?', 'C-WORLD', 'C-SAVE'] P: ['C-GAME']\ngameplay-systems-toolkit :: Reusable gameplay systems: abilities, effects and attributes, gameplay tags, camera system, spawning and pooling, gameplay message routing, photo mode.\n   NR: [['Generic events', 'entity-object-model'], ['Cinematic cameras', 'cinematics-sequencer']]\n   C: ['C-GAME', 'C-NET?', 'C-INPUT?'] P: []\nscripting-runtime :: Scripting language selection, VM embedding and bindings, sandboxing, debugging and profiling, hot reload, visual scripting, AOT/JIT constraints, GC policy.\n   NR: [['Reflection substrate', 'reflection-metadata'], ['Graph editor UI', 'graph-editor-framework']]\n   C: ['C-REFL', 'C-GAME', 'C-RELOAD'] P: ['C-SCRIPT']\nnavigation-pathfinding :: Navmesh generation (tiled, runtime rebuild), grid and hierarchical pathfinding, path following, off-mesh links, 3D/volumetric navigation.\n   NR: [['Crowd avoidance', 'crowd-simulation'], ['Decision making', 'ai-behavior-perception']]\n   C: ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-PHYS', 'C-WORLD', 'C-TASK'] P: ['C-NAV']\nai-behavior-perception :: Decision making (behavior trees, utility, HTN/GOAP, state trees), perception, environment queries, smart objects, AI scheduling and LOD; evaluates learned and LLM-driven agents.\n   NR: [['Navigation', 'navigation-pathfinding'], ['ML runtime', 'ml-inference-runtime']]\n   C: ['C-GAME', 'C-NAV?', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-PHYS'] P: []","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7e1813ae-1663-4288-aad8-3a1f26623fd2","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:47:40.096Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4a35b09a-b467-44b0-988d-69f711eb7a73","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
